        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the person in <Picture 1>. Preserve their face, hairstyle, age and clothing.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A natural photographic portrait of <Subject 1>, framed from the shoulders up. The person breathes gently, blinks once and makes a subtle head movement. Stable camera, soft window light and a simple background. Realistic skin texture, fine pores and natural facial detail. Consistent identity throughout the shot.\n\nvisual_details:\nNatural skin tones, gentle highlights, realistic shadows and clear eyes. No beauty filter, no waxy skin, no exaggerated movements or sudden camera changes.\n\naudio:\nQuiet indoor ambience. No speech, no music.",
